Subject: [PATCH 36/37] Product mode and the repeat guard on by default, after
 blind check 4 passed (=0 turns each off)

Blind set 4 (sealed, separate worker): product shape 0% -> 46% (+0.46, SE 0.07), no answer resent in
either arm, quality -2.0 (SE 2.5, inside the bar), file charts 46% -> 4%, concept flow charts
29% -> 67%. On this branch only.
